<title>HONG KONG: Johnson Electric interim net up 38.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Johnson Electric interim net up 38.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   55.4     vs 40.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    8.0	vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    211.29   vs 152.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,418.06 vs 1,141.70</p>
<p>    Company name		 Johnson Electric Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Dec 27-31</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Jan 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Johnson Electric designs and manufactures micro-motors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
